    "summary": "RewardsHypervisor.deposit() took the caller-supplied `from` contract at face value, reading IVisor(from).owner() as authorization and calling IVisor(from).delegatedTransferERC20() for payment, so an attacker contract that returned itself as owner and no-opped the transfer minted vVISR shares without depositing any VISR."
